        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9420/75 Beaded Cabinet Drop Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull has just enough ornate detail to be interesting but it doesn't take its decorative style over-board. The mounts are embellished with detailed beaded trim and the handle is beautifully shaped.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Similar design <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=41701\"><b>Omnia Ornate Cabinet Pulls</b></a> and matching <a href=\"/products/beaded-finger-cabinet-pull-omnia-9422-35\"><b>Beaded Finger Cabinet Pulls</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's line of sophisticated cabinet hardware have been painstakingly crafted by artisans who understand that a beautiful design must be as comfortable to the hand as it is pleasing to the eyes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Beaded Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction regardless of finish.</li>\r\n<li>Length (center of mount to center of mount): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued. Limited supply available. </b>\r\n</p>",
